    LLM: 'Only the top card of each tableau column is available. Move a card to a foundation (build up by suit from ace to king) or to another tableau column (build up or down by same suit, one card at a time; no round-the-corner). Fill an empty tableau space with any available card. No redeal.',
    Player: 'Only the top card of each tableau column is available. Move a card to a foundation (build up by suit from ace to king) or to another tableau column (build up or down by same suit, one card at a time; no round-the-corner). Fill an empty tableau space with any available card. No redeal.',
